<title>USA: Alabama JBA, $8.110 mln won by Sterne Agee.</title>
<headline>Alabama JBA, $8.110 mln won by Sterne Agee.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sterne Agee &amp; Leach said it won $8.110 million of Alabama Judicial Building Authority, revenue refunding current interest bonds, Series 1996.</p>
</text>
